Term Benefit Trust. That is really about governance, not optics. Anthropic is still trying to prove that frontier AI can be tied to a public benefit mission without handing the whole thing to pure product pressure. https://t.co/ME02JIcdlU","url":"https://x.com/AkshajSatyawada/status/2113022330964160999"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113013644644814848","3_2113013644598685696"]},"author_id":"1572681125952192514","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:04:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113013648197365893"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/gB84bNe4VI","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/MTCMarketsHQ/status/2113013648197365893/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113013644644814848","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/gB84bNe4VI"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/gB84bNe4VI","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/MTCMarketsHQ/status/2113013648197365893/photo/1","media_key":"3_2113013644598685696","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/gB84bNe4VI"}]},"id":"2113013648197365893","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":4,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Meta just dropped some massive AI updates. 🚀\n\n• 10M+ Muse users in just 6 weeks\n• Muse Wonder, its first frontier AI model\n• AI agents handling shopping and transactions\n• 10x compute efficiency improvement targeted\n• Plans to scale Muse to billions of users\n\nMeta isn’t https://t.co/gB84bNe4VI","url":"https://x.com/MTCMarketsHQ/status/2113013648197365893"},{"author_id":"1175714145133633536","created_at":"2026-10-21T22:00:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113027575534817593"],"id":"2113027575534817593","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"\"Key parts of the framework include tightening export controls against China and other adversaries; mandating independent testing for large AI companies; prohibiting the development of advanced AI practices like recursive self-improvement; banning federal use of cameras like","url":"https://x.com/GFuterman/status/2113027575534817593"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2113023880080027648"]},"author_id":"21335196","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:45:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113023931518976256"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/YvfQqagis4","end":302,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/ruthheasman/status/2113023931518976256/video/1","media_key":"13_2113023880080027648","start":279,"url":"https://t.co/YvfQqagis4"}]},"id":"2113023931518976256","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":89,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Today PHP shipped emergency patches for a flaw first spotted in 2020. Nobody could prove it was dangerous. This summer, frontier AI models did.\n\nThe internet runs on things that look right. AI has made looking right free.\n\n🚂 In 1874 the railways had the same problem. Two trains https://t.co/YvfQqagis4","url":"https://x.com/ruthheasman/status/2113023931518976256"},{"author_id":"209800623","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:50:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113025179760652709"],"id":"2113025179760652709","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"AI just uncovered a critical vulnerability putting up to 70% of the world's websites at risk (WSJ).\n\nA massive unauthenticated RCE flaw in PHP (CVSS 9.2), uncovered by frontier AI models. European governments are already pulling public sites offline to patch, and the NSA has","url":"https://x.com/pietro_di_walsi/status/2113025179760652709"},{"author_id":"1810528551680323584","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:38:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113022162542166090"],"id":"2113022162542166090","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Anthropic just shared internal workforce data showing that junior tech roles dropped by 33 percent over the past 18 months, with junior hires plummeting from 27 percent down to just 9 percent. Routine coding and bug hunting, historically the sandbox for entry-level devs, are now","url":"https://x.com/MRchen881/status/2113022162542166090"},{"author_id":"1768649126814658560","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:37:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113021778125537367"],"id":"2113021778125537367","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":157,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"After stepping back from social media significantly the last week, I've realized it's an unhealthy place for me to invest my time and energy.\n\nThe last month has been difficult—to say the least—as I watched the latest frontier AI models wipe out a lot of what I have built over","url":"https://x.com/dangreenheck/status/2113021778125537367"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112980729084952576"]},"author_id":"1495252049319297027","created_at":"2026-10-21T21:00:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113012456213684682"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":223,"start":215,"tag":"EUAIAct"},{"end":237,"start":224,"tag":"AIGovernance"},{"end":256,"start":238,"tag":"RiskProfessionals"}],"urls":[{"description":"Certified EU AI Governance Professional training covers EU AI Act compliance, AI governance, risk classification, transparency, and accountability.","display_url":"riskprofs.com/product/certif…","end":213,"expanded_url":"https://riskprofs.com/product/certified-eu-ai-governance-professional/","images":[{"height":700,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111940393134641152/SOi90UFB?format=jpg&name=orig","width":700},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2111940393134641152/SOi90UFB?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":190,"status":200,"title":"Certified EU AI Governance Professional - Risk Professionals","unwound_url":"https://riskprofs.com/product/certified-eu-ai-governance-professional/","url":"https://t.co/